{"script":"wt_c4_10_1","exps":[{"para":{"tag":"tag_1"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara2"},"key":"top"},{"para":{"noIn":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":0,"scaleX":1,"addImg":"chara010_2ori_face_chara010_2e","layer":"chara2","noOut":false,"x":329,"scaleY":1,"trans":true,"bright":1,"y":-228,"img":"chara010_2ori"},"key":"setLayer"},{"para":{"noIn":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":1,"scaleX":1,"addImg":"chara010_2ori_face_chara010_2e","layer":"chara2","noOut":false,"x":329,"transTime":300,"scaleY":1,"trans":true,"bright":1,"y":-228,"img":"chara010_2ori"},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"首座莉拉","text":"[show]嗯，巨木遗迹中的危机暂时解除了，非常感谢两位的付出。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_4"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara010_2ori_face_chara010_2b","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"首座莉拉","text":"[show]不过眼下的威胁尚未消失。赫尔娜遗迹终究存在着许多徘徊的怨灵，而且还有结社出没的痕迹，不可不防。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_5"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"首座莉拉","text":"[show]这势必会是一场旷日持久的博弈。倘若诸位掌握有关结社的情报，务必即刻上报，毕竟谁也无法预料他们会生出何种事端。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_6"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara010_2ori_face_chara010_2e","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"首座莉拉","text":"[show]当然了，遗迹的事情还烦请继续保密。还希望两位继续为消灭异变而努力，我们也会尽全力支援。拜托了！[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_2"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"noIn":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":0,"scaleX":1,"addImg":"chara010_2ori_face_chara010_2e","layer":"chara2","noOut":false,"x":329,"transTime":300,"scaleY":1,"trans":true,"bright":1,"y":-228,"img":"chara010_2ori"},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"end":true},"key":"end"}],"des":"紧急绝密契约：赫尔娜遗迹"}